EmailTemplate.textOnly:
{!Contact.FirstName},

I wanted to check in and see where you were at with getting the account back on track.  Because of the breach of the Agreement, the account will be reported as defaulted to business credit, which may impact your ability to get additional financing. The file will also be sent to the litigation team for evaluation may include the filing of a lawsuit against you and the business.

I would like to help you avoid this by offering either a reconciliation to adjust your payments as provided for under the terms of the Agreement or by looking at some pre litigation settlement options.

To discuss these options further and avoid potential litigation fees and costs please contact me as soon as possible.

Thank you,
{!Case.Case_Email_Signature_Name_Formula__c}
National Funding, parent and servicing company for Quick Bridge Funding, LLC
{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Street__c}
